WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.507 --> 00:00:04.705
- [Teacher] You're late again.

00:00:04.705 --> 00:00:06.569
- My cat was on fire.

00:00:06.569 --> 00:00:09.736
(upbeat string music)

00:00:15.823 --> 00:00:18.391
Can you not tap your foot?

00:00:18.391 --> 00:00:21.808
Hey, can you not turn your pages so loud?

00:00:22.797 --> 00:00:25.023
Can you not stare at me?

00:00:25.023 --> 00:00:26.007
Hmm?

00:00:26.007 --> 00:00:27.022
- Can I borrow a paper?

00:00:27.022 --> 00:00:28.024
- Yeah.

00:00:28.024 --> 00:00:29.039
- Can I borrow your pen?

00:00:29.039 --> 00:00:30.092
- Oh yeah.

00:00:30.092 --> 00:00:31.098
- Can I borrow $20?

00:00:31.098 --> 00:00:32.157
I forgot my lunch.

00:00:32.157 --> 00:00:33.156
Can I borrow your phone?

00:00:33.156 --> 00:00:34.165
I need to call my mom.

00:00:34.165 --> 00:00:35.213
Can I borrow your car?

00:00:35.213 --> 00:00:37.546
Can I borrow your house key?

00:00:39.596 --> 00:00:42.010
- Hey can I have my...

00:00:42.010 --> 00:00:43.023
Oooh, ooh!

00:00:43.023 --> 00:00:44.773
Oooh, I know, I know!

00:00:46.821 --> 00:00:47.988
Homework, yes!

00:00:54.562 --> 00:00:57.729
I think I'm gonna do the extra credit.

00:01:04.464 --> 00:01:06.466
What'd you get?

00:01:06.466 --> 00:01:08.049
Are you kidding me?

00:01:41.177 --> 00:01:42.186
Here you go.

00:01:42.186 --> 00:01:43.019
- Thanks.

00:01:47.089 --> 00:01:48.339
- You want one?

00:01:53.058 --> 00:01:53.891
Any mmm?

00:01:54.892 --> 00:01:55.725
- Kelsey?

00:01:56.816 --> 00:01:57.649
- Do you want some?

00:01:57.649 --> 00:01:58.482
- No!

00:01:58.482 --> 00:02:00.815
- Oh, you forgot to assign us homework!

00:02:00.815 --> 00:02:01.815
- What?

00:02:01.815 --> 00:02:02.813
- Why?

00:02:02.813 --> 00:02:03.646
- Nooo!

00:02:05.610 --> 00:02:07.860
(laughing)

